    <!-- ========== 邮件安全 ========== -->
    <div class="tab-pane fade" id="tab-spam">
      <div class="row g-3">
        <div class="col-md-6">
          <div class="card">
            <div class="card-header">🛡️ 邮件内容检测</div>
            <div class="card-body">
              <div class="mb-3">
                <label class="form-label">主题</label>
                <input type="text" class="form-control" id="spam-subject" placeholder="邮件主题">
              </div>
              <div class="mb-3">
                <label class="form-label">正文</label>
                <textarea class="form-control" id="spam-body" rows="5" placeholder="粘贴邮件正文..."></textarea>
              </div>
              <button class="btn btn-primary" onclick="checkSpam()">🔍 检测垃圾邮件风险</button>
              <div id="spam-result" class="mt-3" style="display:none"></div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="col-md-6">
          <div class="card">
            <div class="card-header">📧 邮箱验证</div>
            <div class="card-body">
              <div class="mb-3">
                <label class="form-label">邮箱地址</label>
                <input type="email" class="form-control" id="verify-email" placeholder="输入要验证的邮箱">
              </div>
              <button class="btn btn-primary" onclick="verifyEmail()">✅ 验证邮箱</button>
              <div id="verify-result" class="mt-3" style="display:none"></div>
              <hr>
              <label class="form-label">批量验证</label>
              <textarea class="form-control mb-2" id="verify-batch" rows="3" placeholder="每行一个邮箱地址..."></textarea>
              <button class="btn btn-outline-primary btn-sm" onclick="verifyBatch()">🔍 批量验证</button>
              <div id="batch-result" class="mt-3" style="display:none"></div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="card mt-3">
            <div class="card-header">🎯 意图检测</div>
            <div class="card-body">
              <textarea class="form-control mb-2" id="intent-text" rows="3" placeholder="粘贴客户消息..."></textarea>
              <button class="btn btn-primary btn-sm" onclick="detectIntent()">🔍 检测意图</button>
              <div id="intent-result" class="mt-3" style="display:none"></div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

  
    <!-- ========== 域名认证检测 ========== -->
    <div class="tab-pane fade" id="tab-auth">
      <div class="row g-3">
        <div class="col-md-6">
          <div class="card">
            <div class="card-header">🔒 SPF/DKIM/DMARC 检测</div>
            <div class="card-body">
              <div class="mb-3">
                <label class="form-label">发件域名</label>
                <input type="text" class="form-control" id="auth-domain" placeholder="example.com">
                <small class="text-muted">输入域名检查邮件认证DNS记录</small>
              </div>
              <button class="btn btn-primary" onclick="checkDomainAuth()">🔍 检测域名认证</button>
              <div id="auth-result" class="mt-3" style="display:none"></div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="col-md-6">
          <div class="card">
            <div class="card-header">📖 邮件认证说明</div>
            <div class="card-body">
              <h6>SPF（Sender Policy Framework）</h6>
              <p class="text-muted small">指定哪些IP/服务器可以代表你的域名发邮件。没有SPF，邮件会被当成伪造。</p>
              <h6>DKIM（DomainKeys Identified Mail）</h6>
              <p class="text-muted small">对邮件内容进行数字签名，接收方可验证邮件未被篡改。</p>
              <h6>DMARC（Domain-based Message Authentication）</h6>
              <p class="text-muted small">告诉接收方如何处理SPF/DKIM验证失败的邮件（拒收/隔离/放行）。</p>
              <hr>
              <div class="alert alert-warning mb-0"><strong>2026年Gmail/Outlook要求：</strong>发送超过5000封/天的域名必须同时配置SPF+DKIM+DMARC，否则直接拒收。</div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

